  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa 118 - Digital starter pack to SMEs in Tanzania, Mozambique, Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is an expansion of the previous project in Ethiopia, and Africa 118 seeks support for a &quot;trial project&quot; for expansion to Tanzania, Mozambique and Ghana. The structure is similar to the Ethiopia project, and Africa 118 will target 1000 SMEs (mostly export-oriented) in each country. Each SME will be provided a Digital Starter Pack (a professional website and hosting package) to help them accelerate their growth by marketing their products effectively.</narrative>
  </description>
